.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
orbit-port-allocate - Suggest a free dynamic port that no registry entry claims; not reserved


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit port allocate   [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Suggest a free dynamic port that no registry entry claims; not reserved


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for allocate

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Print the result as a JSON envelope

.PP
\fB--root\fP=""
	workspace root holding handbook/agents/workspace/ports.yaml (default: the workspace containing the current directory)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBorbit-port(1)\fP
